<title>HONG KONG: Wing Hang Bank 1996 profit up 22.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Wing Hang Bank 1996 profit up 22.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   315.0  vs 257.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    78.0   vs 63.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    770.73 vs 629.81</p>
<p>    Company name		 Wing Hang Bank Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  April 21-24</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   May 8</p>
<p>NOTE - Wing Hang Bank provides banking, financial services.</p>
<p>It proposed a special dividend of 12 H.K. cents per share and a bonus issue of one share for every five shares held. Total dividend for year is HK$1.26 (including inteirm dividend of 36 cents and special dividend 12 cents) vs 93 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
